<title>FRANCE: France to sell 3,000 T wheat to Iraq as food aid.</title>
<headline>France to sell 3,000 T wheat to Iraq as food aid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold a tender on March 26 to sell 3,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Iraq via the Rome-based World Food Programme, national grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment in bulk and in bags between April 8 and April 30.</p>
<p>France will also hold a food tender on March 26 to supply 2,500 tonnes of soft wheat to Zaire, 730 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sao Tome and 5,000 tonnes of maize to Haiti.</p>
<p>Shipment dates also run from April 8 through April 30.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
